WEBVTT

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 24]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.920 line:0%
The embroidery on your attire, Mr. Xu,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.480 line:0%
is truly exquisite.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.940 line:0%
I wonder which lady embroidered

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.200 line:0%
the peach blossom pattern on the collar

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.440 line:0%
for you.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.809 line:0%
You jest, My Lord.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.520 line:0%
I simply have a fondness for peach blossoms,

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.520 line:0%
so I had the attire custom-made with such embroidery.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.640 line:0%
I see.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.890 line:0%
No wonder it looks so familiar.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.130 line:0%
I have seen

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.240 line:0%
this embroidery in a tailor's shop

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.280 line:0%
before.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:07.560 line:0%
It is indeed

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.960 line:0%
a popular style this year.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.680 line:0%
If I remember correctly,

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.960 line:0%
this set should have an outer robe as well.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.400 line:0%
Why aren't you wearing it, Mr. Xu?

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:26.920 line:0%
Perhaps... I was too busy tonight and forgot.

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:30.110 line:0%
I've forgotten where I left it.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.460 line:0%
Indeed, you were very busy this evening.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.480 line:0%
Mistakes are inevitable in the midst of chaos, right?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.260 line:0%
Then what is

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:49.700 line:0%
this powder?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.560 line:0%
If my nose does not deceive me,

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.640 line:0%
this should be the legendary

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.760 line:0%
datura powder.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.400 line:0%
I...

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.080 line:0%
I've never heard of

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.480 line:0%
any datura powder.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.040 line:0%
I don't know

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.280 line:0%
why it's on me either.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.200 line:0%
My Lord, please investigate clearly!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.400 line:0%
I really have nothing to do

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.520 line:0%
with Lady Du's abduction!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.760 line:0%
Is that so?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:11.710 line:0%
Guard Jing.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.040 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:16.920 line:0%
we found

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.240 line:0%
this robe on the road.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.470 line:0%
It's yours, isn't it?

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.840 line:0%
You want to say

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:34.440 line:0%
this robe isn't yours?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.860 line:0%
In your haste to escape,

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.120 line:0%
you discarded your outer robe,

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.020 line:0%
not realizing

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.120 line:0%
the silver thread at the collar

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.060 line:0%
had caught on your inner garment.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.320 line:0%
You also forgot

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.080 line:0%
the datura powder was still

00:03:49.129 --> 00:03:51.360 line:0%
in the inner pocket of your outer robe.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.160 line:0%
And the knock-out powder

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.580 line:0%
has also lingered on your inner garment.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.230 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.320 line:0%
you used the knock-out powder to tranquilize the bride.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.520 line:0%
You're a habitual offender.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.440 line:0%
You are the mastermind behind the kidnapping case.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.480 line:0%
You even killed your own accomplice!

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.280 line:0%
No.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.780 line:0%
It's not like that.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.400 line:0%
I didn't kill anyone!

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.000 line:0%
I really didn't kill anyone!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.000 line:0%
My Lord,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.800 line:0%
I did use the knock-out powder.

00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:17.360 line:0%
I was bewitched by the bride's beauty,

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.680 line:0%
but... but My Lord,

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.920 line:0%
I really didn't kill anyone!

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.560 line:0%
You're such a shameless scoundrel!

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.080 line:0%
Not a single word you said is true!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:23.920 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:24.920 line:0%
there's no need to speak further with him.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:25.600 line:0%
Guards!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:26.840 line:0%
Use the clamping rods!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:27.640 line:0%
Yes!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.120 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.180 line:0%
please allow me...

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.900 line:0%
No, no, no!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:56.860 line:0%
My Lord.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.520 line:0%
I confess. I confess.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.490 line:0%
I'll confess everything.

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.440 line:0%
Then tell us everything you did tonight

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.360 line:0%
honestly.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.790 line:0%
I was pedantic

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.470 line:0%
and only believed

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.970 line:0%
within books lie beauties fair as jade.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.930 line:0%
But after becoming a wedding host,

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.570 line:0%
I suddenly realized

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.370 line:0%
I don't need to read to possess a beauty.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.360 line:0%
With just a little knock-out powder,

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.240 line:0%
the brides in grand courtyards

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.620 line:0%
could all become my beauties.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.170 line:0%
It concerns their privacy

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.440 line:0%
and reputation,

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.959 line:0%
so I could succeed in most cases.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.780 line:0%
And no one would speak of it.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.680 line:0%
Then why did you target

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.500 line:0%
Lady Du this time?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.300 line:0%
I have no particular hobbies,

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.490 line:0%
except my fondness for beautiful women.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:57.920 line:0%
I heard of Lady Du's beauty

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.320 line:0%
a long time ago.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.050 line:0%
How could I pass up the opportunity

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.960 line:0%
to spend a night

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.380 line:0%
with the fairest woman in Yingzhou?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.240 line:0%
Your accomplice,

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.840 line:0%
who is now dead—

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.900 line:0%
what is his name?

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.240 line:0%
What was his relationship with you?

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.610 line:0%
He was just a ruffian.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.290 line:0%
I only know he was called

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.970 line:0%
Er Laipi.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.210 line:0%
He had no parents,

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.600 line:0%
robbed houses, and had been in jail.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.750 line:0%
Before the man in black arrived,

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.430 line:0%
you two were already arguing.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.050 line:0%
What were you arguing about?

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.080 line:0%
I decided to stop the crime

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.920 line:0%
and send Lady Du back.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:41.640 line:0%
No.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.720 line:0%
I made a mistake.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:43.680 line:0%
Release her.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.120 line:0%
Are you kidding me?

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.360 line:0%
What's done is done.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.520 line:0%
There is no turning back.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.200 line:0%
I said I made a mistake. Release her!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:49.600 line:0%
You...

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.680 line:0%
Suddenly, there was a noise from afar.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.640 line:0%
I'll go over there to take a look.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.200 line:0%
I thought someone was following us.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.930 line:0%
So we stopped arguing.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.770 line:0%
Er Laipi

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.000 line:0%
was responsible for putting

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.240 line:0%
Lady Du in the cellar.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.740 line:0%
I was responsible for checking the surroundings.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.000 line:0%
But there was nothing.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.080 line:0%
It might just be a wild cat.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:11.840 line:0%
Er Laipi,

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.230 line:0%
I didn't see anything.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.840 line:0%
Just a wild cat in the bushes.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:17.210 line:0%
It must have been the sound of the wild cat.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.340 line:0%
I was terrified.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.040 line:0%
I was worried the killer would come back

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.520 line:0%
and kill me too.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.240 line:0%
So I ran away.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.070 line:0%
Xu Jize,

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:28.720 line:0%
regarding the real killer you mentioned,

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.920 line:0%
apart from yourself,

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.690 line:0%
are there any other witnesses?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.970 line:0%
Since there aren't any,

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:35.920 line:0%
how can you prove

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.750 line:0%
he didn't die from

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.360 line:0%
your internal strife?

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.450 line:0%
If I were to fight with Er Laipi,

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.940 line:0%
he would surely have the upper hand.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:48.920 line:0%
What ability do I have

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:50.360 line:0%
to kill him?

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:51.600 line:0%
My Lord,

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.780 line:0%
please investigate thoroughly.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.080 line:0%
Regarding Er Laipi's death,

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.320 line:0%
I will investigate it thoroughly

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:58.920 line:0%
and draw a conclusion later.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.680 line:0%
The case of Lady Du is supported by conclusive evidence.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.480 line:0%
Guards,

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.200 line:0%
take the criminal Xu Jize into custody!

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:05.860 line:0%
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.080 line:0%
Move!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.240 line:0%
What?

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.480 line:0%
You're still up after a long night?

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.490 line:0%
The fearless Secretary Yan,

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:52.480 line:0%
are you so afraid of sharing a bed with your husband?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.400 line:0%
I do want to rest,

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:55.560 line:0%
but the moment I lie down,

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.240 line:0%
my mind is filled with the case.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.840 line:0%
The case was solved rather smoothly,

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:01.300 line:0%
but I feel there's more beneath the surface.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:02.160 line:0%
Smoothly?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.720 line:0%
We chased the culprit until midnight,

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.280 line:0%
spent hours making him confess,

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.120 line:0%
and only resorted to torture

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.780 line:0%
to make him spill everything.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.000 line:0%
I wasn't just talking

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.960 line:0%
about the bride's abduction case.

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:13.680 line:0%
Even though this case is closed,

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.280 line:0%
the bandit Er Laipi is dead.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.280 line:0%
And now there's a new murder case.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.120 line:0%
Er Laipi was a robber.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.200 line:0%
In Yingzhou City,

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.980 line:0%
he must have had many enemies.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.480 line:0%
What kind of personal grudge would lead

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.020 line:0%
someone to kill him so mysteriously?

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.200 line:0%
After killing him,

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.960 line:0%
the killer even took his eyes.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.240 line:0%
Was the killer's appearance a coincidence

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.600 line:0%
or was it prearranged?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.800 line:0%
It's not something we can figure out right away.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.930 line:0%
Get some rest first.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.670 line:0%
I told you I can't sleep.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.690 line:0%
Among Er Laipi's friends and relatives,

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.950 line:0%
the most likely suspect seems to be...

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.670 line:0%
Since you're so energetic,

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.090 line:0%
why don't we do something else?

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:55.880 line:0%
What...

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.410 line:0%
What are you going to do?

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:07.800 line:0%
What a husband

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.760 line:0%
and wife should do, of course.

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.370 line:0%
Are you... Are you...

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.500 line:0%
Are you out of your mind?

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.890 line:0%
People call me the White Ghost.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.480 line:0%
They say I'm a man

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.480 line:0%
of my word.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.740 line:0%
How come in your eyes,

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:28.040 line:0%
I'm suddenly a madman?

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.900 line:0%
What did you give me?

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.580 line:0%
A sweet sleep pill.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.680 line:0%
It helps one fall asleep quickly.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.410 line:0%
Have a good dream later, Honey.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:52.260 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.280 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.050 line:0%
There's a letter from Xiang'an.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.450 line:0%
What letter is so urgent?

00:10:58.240 --> 00:10:59.880 line:0%
My wife was just about to sleep.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.800 line:0%
And I didn't give you permission to come in.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.200 line:0%
Forgive me, Grand Commander.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.600 line:0%
It's just that you said we should report immediately

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.660 line:0%
if there's a letter from this person.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.800 line:0%
An urgent letter from Xiang'an?

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:11.920 line:0%
Who sent it?

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.570 line:0%
Madam Xu.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.680 line:0%
Nothing unusual.

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:42.670 line:0%
[To Grand Commander Shen Du]

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:43.770 line:0%
Would you like to read it first, Honey?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:43.700 line:0%
[To Grand Commander Shen Du]

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:46.720 line:0%
No, no, no.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.880 line:0%
I don't want to read your love letter.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.050 line:0%
[To Grand Commander Shen Du]

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:50.690 line:0%
I'm sleepy. I'm going to bed.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.280 line:0%
There's no romance between

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.720 line:0%
Madam Xu and me.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.720 line:0%
Besides, the one I care about

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:58.920 line:0%
is someone else.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:03.240 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.310 line:0%
The pill's effect couldn't have been timelier.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.280 line:0%
We are Half-faced Ghosts.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:11.010 line:0%
When can you find my head?

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:14.270 line:0%
Give me your head.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.210 line:0%
Who's there?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.240 line:0%
Who is it?

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.390 line:0%
Show yourself!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.040 line:0%
Eyes.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:26.550 line:0%
My eyes!

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:27.660 line:0%
No!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.400 line:0%
This is...

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.760 line:0%
a red-feathered gray pigeon?

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.900 line:0%
A red-feathered gray pigeon is here.

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.440 line:0%
It means that within Yingzhou City,

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.080 line:0%
there must be

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.120 line:0%
spies of the grand empress dowager.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.940 line:0%
[You can send a message when you see a red-feathered gray pigeon.]

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.180 line:0%
They can't show up,

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.960 line:0%
so they're using this gray pigeon to remind me

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.440 line:0%
that it's time to report to Imperial City.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.410 line:0%
Sister.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.280 line:0%
Sister.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.680 line:0%
Did you bring this gray pigeon?

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.710 line:0%
You are...

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.520 line:0%
No.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.960 line:0%
I saw this red-feathered gray pigeon

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.070 line:0%
fly into your courtyard.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.840 line:0%
It lingered, unwilling to leave.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.640 line:0%
Sister,

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.240 line:0%
do you know the legend?

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:26.240 line:0%
If a red-feathered gray pigeon

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.120 line:0%
nests in your house,

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.520 line:0%
it means good fortune is coming.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:29.600 line:0%
We must keep it.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.320 line:0%
So I rushed to the market

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.820 line:0%
and bought you a birdcage.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:33.730 line:0%
I see.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.040 line:0%
So you came

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.570 line:0%
just to bring me a birdcage?

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.500 line:0%
There's one more thing.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.720 line:0%
The deer antler on the medicine list has run out.

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.800 line:0%
But Gannan Area is short of medicinal materials.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.040 line:0%
I went to the largest pharmacy in the city,

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:46.960 line:0%
Guangchun Hall.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:47.720 line:0%
But they said they've never

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.480 line:0%
purchased rare goods like deer antler.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:50.920 line:0%
They only have cistanche.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.320 line:0%
It seems we'll have to source it elsewhere.

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.800 line:0%
They have cistanche?

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.600 line:0%
Its potency is weaker,

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.880 line:0%
but it can still be used as a substitute.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:58.480 line:0%
The shopkeeper

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.520 line:0%
offered me the last bit,

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.650 line:0%
but I didn't take it.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:01.720 line:0%
Take me there.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:02.560 line:0%
Let's go buy it now.

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.200 line:0%
Okay.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:12.680 line:0%
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:23.190 line:0%
[Guangchun Hall]

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:14.900 line:0%
Be careful.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.730 line:0%
Business at large pharmacies is indeed booming.

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:31.640 line:0%
Even their pots for decocting medicine

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:33.080 line:0%
have been custom-made this big.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.840 line:0%
They probably are not for decocting medicine.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:38.240 line:0%
They look more like storage containers for medicinal herbs.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.240 line:0%
Right, Yeyun,

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.120 line:0%
I asked you to keep an eye on Governor's Mansion

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.320 line:0%
and see if there's anyone suspicious going in or out.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.320 line:0%
Have you noticed anything?

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.520 line:0%
Sister, I always keep

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.160 line:0%
the tasks you give me in mind.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.160 line:0%
I haven't noticed anyone suspicious,

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.080 line:0%
but I did hear about

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.320 line:0%
a strange place.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.440 line:0%
I heard there's a side courtyard in Governor's Mansion.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.040 line:0%
No one is allowed to go there.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.530 line:0%
But Governor Mo himself often goes there.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.440 line:0%
In a bitterly cold border city like Yingzhou,

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.840 line:0%
there are actually peonies blooming here.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:20.540 line:0%
Pink peonies?

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:23.700 line:0%
Grand Commander, this way, please.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:24.140 line:0%
Okay.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.650 line:0%
What is he doing here?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.020 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:55.830 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.110 line:0%
Yingzhou is located in the cold north.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.770 line:0%
It often snows here in winter.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.090 line:0%
But you have such a warm room for growing flowers.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.850 line:0%
That must have taken considerable effort.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:46.900 line:0%
Senior.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:00.030 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.880 line:0%
Senior, do you really have to be

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:16.960 line:0%
so distant with me?

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.590 line:0%
Now,

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.070 line:0%
you have a high status.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.040 line:0%
I have tasted

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.640 line:0%
the perils of bureaucratic life.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.160 line:0%
I only wish to live in peace.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.880 line:0%
I don't want to forge ties with you,

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.920 line:0%
lest it should put you in a difficult position.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.530 line:0%
Please forgive me.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.640 line:0%
In front of others,

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.360 line:0%
you don't want to be associated with me.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.700 line:0%
I can understand that.

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.560 line:0%
But now it's just the two of us.

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.240 line:0%
Senior, do you have to

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.680 line:0%
push me away?

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.360 line:0%
Back then,

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.560 line:0%
you were sent to the Prisoner's Center,

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.420 line:0%
suffering countless hardships.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.700 line:0%
At its root,

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:06.880 line:0%
it was the entanglements of officialdom

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.080 line:0%
that implicated you.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.430 line:0%
So from that moment on,

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.480 line:0%
I hoped you

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.200 line:0%
could stay away

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.560 line:0%
from the court.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:14.260 line:0%
But unexpectedly,

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.800 line:0%
your extraordinary talents couldn't be hidden.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.200 line:0%
After all the twists and turns,

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.000 line:0%
you still caught the grand empress dowager's eye.

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:22.280 line:0%
Now,

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:23.920 line:0%
you are the grand commander,

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.240 line:0%
while I

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:28.090 line:0%
can only remain a lowly official.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.270 line:0%
I see.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.330 line:0%
You're blaming me.

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.540 line:0%
Extraordinary talents?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.230 line:0%
Catching the grand empress dowager's eye?

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.800 line:0%
Among the old acquaintances of the Shen family

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.270 line:0%
and my father's old friends,

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.220 line:0%
everyone knows

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:54.960 line:0%
I betrayed my father for glory

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.940 line:0%
and drove my birth mother to her death.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.320 line:0%
That was how I was removed from the list of the guilty.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:00.810 line:0%
I'm here to report!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.790 line:0%
I, Shen Du, son of the guilty official Shen Bingzhu,

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.170 line:0%
am here to denounce my father!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.850 line:0%
Everyone can despise me

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.370 line:0%
for my heartless behavior.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:24.880 line:0%
Especially you, Senior.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:27.850 line:0%
You must regret it very much.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.260 line:0%
Back then, on the imperial street,

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.460 line:0%
you knelt all the way to the palace

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.360 line:0%
to petition for mercy on behalf of the Shen family.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.510 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:48.950 line:0%
Deputy Minister Shen is innocent!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.260 line:0%
[Petition]

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.190 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.950 line:0%
The Shen family's women and children are innocent!

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.400 line:0%
It was only because of your loyalty

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:14.560 line:0%
that the late emperor

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.760 line:0%
spared my mother and me from execution.

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:20.600 line:0%
Then I was sent to the Prisoner's Center.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.440 line:0%
No need

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:23.580 line:0%
to dwell on it.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.080 line:0%
My family came down in the world.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.890 line:0%
Fortunately, Mentor took me in.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.370 line:0%
He was very kind to the Mo family,

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:34.630 line:0%
treating me like his own son.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.160 line:0%
Pleading for justice

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:38.940 line:0%
before the emperor was my duty.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:40.820 line:0%
If I just stood by and watched,

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.310 line:0%
that would truly make me disloyal and ungrateful.

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:45.640 line:0%
Senior, you gave up your promising future

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.820 line:0%
and were exiled to the frontier with no hope of promotion.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:49.950 line:0%
It was all for the sake of me,

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.710 line:0%
an ungrateful, disloyal,

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.620 line:0%
and unfilial person.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.000 line:0%
I traded my father's reputation

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.100 line:0%
for my bright future.

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:01.480 line:0%
Senior,

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:06.330 line:0%
if you had known it would come to this,

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:10.840 line:0%
would you regret it?

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.720 line:0%
Looking back,

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:17.640 line:0%
I have many regrets,

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:19.910 line:0%
but saving you

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:22.850 line:0%
is never one of them.

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:28.280 line:0%
What you did back then

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:30.440 line:0%
was an act of desperation.

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:31.960 line:0%
In heaven, Mentor

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:33.420 line:0%
would surely understand.

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:35.490 line:0%
As for your mother,

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:38.630 line:0%
she kicked you out of the Shen family out of anger.

00:22:38.680 --> 00:22:39.440 line:0%
It was just

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:40.520 line:0%
a show for those

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:41.800 line:0%
vile people.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:44.200 line:0%
She did that

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:46.670 line:0%
to protect her only son.

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:47.980 line:0%
Senior,

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:50.370 line:0%
do you really not blame me?

00:22:57.260 --> 00:22:58.920 line:0%
Do you recognize this flower?

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:01.910 line:0%
I do.

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:07.070 line:0%
It's Xiuxiu's favorite, the Child's Face Peony.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:20.780 line:0%
Where are we going?

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:23.270 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:24.840 line:0%
Look.

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:26.440 line:0%
Brother Du is impressive.

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:29.070 line:0%
He managed to grow Child's Face Peonies for me.

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:34.240 line:0%
Du,

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:35.600 line:0%
you'll spoil Mo Xiuxiu

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.800 line:0%
if you continue to pamper her like this.

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.120 line:0%
It might not be likely

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:40.680 line:0%
to grow even just one

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:42.080 line:0%
Child's Face Peony out of dozens of peonies.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.160 line:0%
Other young girls

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:44.080 line:0%
would be thrilled

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.080 line:0%
to have a peony in their hair.

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:45.840 line:0%
But you

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:47.300 line:0%
only want a Child's Face Peony.

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:48.160 line:0%
What's wrong with that?

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.840 line:0%
I just love Child's Face Peonies.

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:50.890 line:0%
Brother Du,

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.160 line:0%
this one in my hair

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:53.790 line:0%
will wilt in a few days.

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:54.680 line:0%
By then,

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:56.800 line:0%
remember to give me the best one.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:57.560 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:59.060 line:0%
I already have one in mind.

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:00.920 line:0%
I'll pick it for you in a few days.

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:05.630 line:0%
After Xiuxiu died,

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:06.880 line:0%
I built

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.080 line:0%
this courtyard full of peonies for her.

00:24:09.220 --> 00:24:10.550 line:0%
That was when I realized

00:24:11.360 --> 00:24:12.360 line:0%
how difficult it was

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:13.320 line:0%
for you to grow

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:15.560 line:0%
those Child's Face Peonies back then.

00:24:18.800 --> 00:24:19.600 line:0%
Du,

00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:21.720 line:0%
why would I blame you?

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:23.960 line:0%
I'd only be thankful.

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:27.160 line:0%
I'm thankful that you adapted to the circumstances

00:24:27.160 --> 00:24:28.400 line:0%
and survived.

00:24:29.480 --> 00:24:30.610 line:0%
So now in this world,

00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:33.400 line:0%
there is one more person like me

00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:35.070 line:0%
who cares about Xiuxiu

00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:36.690 line:0%
and remembers her.

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:38.410 line:0%
Life is unpredictable.

00:24:40.280 --> 00:24:41.520 line:0%
I never thought

00:24:42.730 --> 00:24:44.930 line:0%
our farewell in Imperial City back then

00:24:46.880 --> 00:24:48.940 line:0%
was my final goodbye to Xiuxiu.

00:24:50.610 --> 00:24:52.390 line:0%
If Xiuxiu were still alive,

00:24:53.480 --> 00:24:54.200 line:0%
she would be

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:55.680 line:0%
about Lady Du's age now.

00:25:03.920 --> 00:25:04.720 line:0%
Senior,

00:25:08.050 --> 00:25:10.850 line:0%
there's something I've always been afraid to ask.

00:25:14.690 --> 00:25:16.430 line:0%
How did Xiuxiu die?

00:25:22.670 --> 00:25:24.330 line:0%
I didn't take good care of her.

00:25:24.940 --> 00:25:26.620 line:0%
She couldn't adapt to the new environment.

00:25:26.620 --> 00:25:27.880 line:0%
She died of an illness.

00:25:36.040 --> 00:25:37.130 line:0%
Xiuxiu?

00:25:37.730 --> 00:25:39.010 line:0%
I remember now.

00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:42.160 line:0%
That rattan-woven pig and letter paper

00:25:42.160 --> 00:25:44.100 line:0%
were gifts from Mo Xiuxiu.

00:25:44.440 --> 00:25:46.370 line:0%
That's why he's been keeping them.

00:25:55.370 --> 00:25:56.550 line:0%
Mo Xiuxiu,

00:25:56.780 --> 00:25:58.510 line:0%
what did you write?

00:26:01.640 --> 00:26:02.440 line:0%
Sir,

00:26:02.520 --> 00:26:04.200 line:0%
you scared them.

00:26:04.480 --> 00:26:05.810 line:0%
It's alright.

00:26:06.170 --> 00:26:09.170 line:0%
Everyone, continue with your calligraphy practice.

00:26:11.890 --> 00:26:13.450 line:0%
It seems these children

00:26:13.960 --> 00:26:15.100 line:0%
still haven't recovered

00:26:15.100 --> 00:26:17.100 line:0%
from the trauma of being kidnapped.

00:26:19.080 --> 00:26:19.980 line:0%
Du,

00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:21.720 line:0%
go get me some cattail leaves.

00:26:21.720 --> 00:26:22.360 line:0%
Okay.

00:26:28.560 --> 00:26:29.360 line:0%
Sir.

00:26:32.200 --> 00:26:33.120 line:0%
Master.

00:26:33.480 --> 00:26:34.480 line:0%
That's all

00:26:34.480 --> 00:26:35.610 line:0%
for today's lesson.

00:26:35.980 --> 00:26:36.780 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:38.260 line:0%
Kids,

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:39.960 line:0%
later,

00:26:40.040 --> 00:26:41.540 line:0%
I will use cattail leaves

00:26:41.720 --> 00:26:43.920 line:0%
to teach you how to weave small animals.

00:26:44.040 --> 00:26:44.920 line:0%
How does that sound?

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:45.850 line:0%
-Great.
-Great.

00:26:52.940 --> 00:26:53.920 line:0%
Brother Shen,

00:26:54.020 --> 00:26:55.880 line:0%
am I weaving this correctly?

00:26:57.600 --> 00:26:58.560 line:0%
Brother,

00:26:58.880 --> 00:27:00.690 line:0%
help me start.

00:27:30.560 --> 00:27:31.940 line:0%
You're so good at this.

00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:33.480 line:0%
I want to make one for Brother Du

00:27:33.480 --> 00:27:35.090 line:0%
as a birthday gift.

00:27:35.480 --> 00:27:37.120 line:0%
Can we trade?

00:27:37.680 --> 00:27:39.100 line:0%
Sure, take it.

00:27:42.400 --> 00:27:43.340 line:0%
Thank you.

00:27:43.520 --> 00:27:44.940 line:0%
What's your name?

00:27:45.160 --> 00:27:47.700 line:0%
Just call me Xing.

00:27:53.800 --> 00:27:54.880 line:0%
Those are gifts

00:27:54.880 --> 00:27:56.160 line:0%
from Mo Xiuxiu.

00:27:56.920 --> 00:27:58.850 line:0%
That's why he's been keeping them.

00:27:59.580 --> 00:28:01.240 line:0%
So the person he's in love with

00:28:01.430 --> 00:28:02.730 line:0%
is Mo Xiuxiu.

00:28:21.560 --> 00:28:22.440 line:0%
Today, you

00:28:22.440 --> 00:28:24.370 line:0%
insisted on meeting me in private.

00:28:24.440 --> 00:28:25.760 line:0%
Why?

00:28:25.760 --> 00:28:27.090 line:0%
You know the Shen family

00:28:27.600 --> 00:28:28.880 line:0%
was wrongly accused.

00:28:29.160 --> 00:28:30.600 line:0%
I was too young at that time,

00:28:30.600 --> 00:28:32.400 line:0%
so I can't remember many things clearly.

00:28:32.400 --> 00:28:34.320 line:0%
I hope you can tell me the details.

00:28:36.800 --> 00:28:37.800 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:28:38.720 --> 00:28:39.600 line:0%
so many years

00:28:39.600 --> 00:28:40.720 line:0%
have passed.

00:28:40.840 --> 00:28:42.080 line:0%
You've achieved success and gained fame.

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:43.440 line:0%
You have a promising future.

00:28:43.440 --> 00:28:45.240 line:0%
Don't dwell on the past.

00:28:49.470 --> 00:28:50.910 line:0%
Senior, what do you mean?

00:28:51.590 --> 00:28:53.790 line:0%
The suffering in the Prisoner's Center

00:28:53.930 --> 00:28:56.080 line:0%
is beyond what an ordinary person can endure.

00:28:56.080 --> 00:28:56.880 line:0%
Du,

00:28:57.520 --> 00:28:58.830 line:0%
now that you're free,

00:28:59.560 --> 00:29:01.560 line:0%
don't think about seeking revenge.

00:29:02.640 --> 00:29:04.440 line:0%
It's not about seeking revenge.

00:29:06.600 --> 00:29:08.530 line:0%
But I'm a member of the Shen family.

00:29:11.030 --> 00:29:13.030 line:0%
The Shen family deserves the truth.

00:29:22.420 --> 00:29:23.280 line:0%
You've gained

00:29:23.280 --> 00:29:24.860 line:0%
the grand empress dowager's deep trust.

00:29:24.860 --> 00:29:26.390 line:0%
As long as you live in peace,

00:29:26.410 --> 00:29:28.680 line:0%
your future possibilities are limitless.

00:29:28.680 --> 00:29:30.120 line:0%
Do you really have the courage

00:29:30.120 --> 00:29:30.880 line:0%
to give up everything

00:29:30.880 --> 00:29:32.360 line:0%
you have now?

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:34.120 line:0%
If you want to thoroughly investigate the case,

00:29:34.120 --> 00:29:34.880 line:0%
you'll certainly have to forsake

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:36.320 line:0%
everything you currently possess.

00:29:36.320 --> 00:29:37.240 line:0%
Do you think

00:29:37.880 --> 00:29:38.800 line:0%
it's worth it?

00:29:42.230 --> 00:29:43.440 line:0%
Throughout history,

00:29:43.630 --> 00:29:44.960 line:0%
those who could reinvestigate old cases

00:29:44.960 --> 00:29:46.400 line:0%
had no weaknesses.

00:29:46.580 --> 00:29:48.030 line:0%
But now you're married.

00:29:48.530 --> 00:29:50.590 line:0%
Can you really disregard everything

00:29:50.640 --> 00:29:51.440 line:0%
and do whatever it takes

00:29:51.440 --> 00:29:52.760 line:0%
just for yourself?

00:29:57.490 --> 00:29:58.810 line:0%
I'll say it again.

00:29:59.240 --> 00:30:02.150 line:0%
♫My heart burned, leaving me cold and forlorn♫

00:29:59.760 --> 00:30:00.560 line:0%
Let bygones

00:30:01.620 --> 00:30:03.240 line:0%
be bygones.

00:30:02.520 --> 00:30:04.980 line:0%
♫And a lifetime of loneliness♫

00:30:03.780 --> 00:30:04.780 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:06.040 line:0%
I've given you

00:30:06.060 --> 00:30:07.460 line:0%
the answer you asked for.

00:30:06.650 --> 00:30:09.490 line:0%
♫My love blazed. Where did it scatter♫

00:30:08.220 --> 00:30:09.610 line:0%
Please

00:30:09.710 --> 00:30:11.740 line:0%
♫And where did it leave its marks?♫

00:30:11.650 --> 00:30:12.640 line:0%
think twice.

00:30:13.120 --> 00:30:15.380 line:0%
♫Drifting through the mist♫

00:30:15.870 --> 00:30:20.070 line:0%
♫Amidst the vast, endless waves, I searched in the darkness♫

00:30:19.230 --> 00:30:24.050 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:30:21.870 --> 00:30:25.280 line:0%
♫You passed by, igniting fireworks♫

00:30:27.740 --> 00:30:32.890 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:30:28.790 --> 00:30:34.970 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:30:34.730 --> 00:30:39.680 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:30:41.900 --> 00:30:45.700 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:30:46.130 --> 00:30:48.550 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:30:49.740 --> 00:30:53.430 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:30:57.130 --> 00:31:06.180 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:31:17.440 --> 00:31:18.680 line:0%
His relationship with Mo Qianzhi

00:31:18.680 --> 00:31:19.810 line:0%
is indeed very deep.

00:31:20.400 --> 00:31:22.080 line:0%
But everyone would say

00:31:22.720 --> 00:31:25.050 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi is an incorruptible official.

00:31:27.720 --> 00:31:29.080 line:0%
Pigeon,

00:31:29.360 --> 00:31:30.200 line:0%
how should I

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:31.900 line:0%
report to the grand empress dowager?

00:31:31.900 --> 00:31:32.930 line:0%
Sister Master!

00:31:33.100 --> 00:31:34.080 line:0%
Sister Master?

00:31:34.080 --> 00:31:34.960 line:0%
What did I tell you?

00:31:34.960 --> 00:31:36.560 line:0%
You should behave yourself.

00:31:37.240 --> 00:31:38.320 line:0%
As I said,

00:31:38.340 --> 00:31:39.160 line:0%
Sister came early in the morning

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:40.200 line:0%
to make medicinal soup.

00:31:40.200 --> 00:31:41.680 line:0%
Where in the world can you find such a good wife?

00:31:41.680 --> 00:31:42.680 line:0%
Who could possibly be worthy of her?

00:31:42.680 --> 00:31:43.440 line:0%
A lady like Madam

00:31:43.440 --> 00:31:44.520 line:0%
is indeed rare in this world.

00:31:44.520 --> 00:31:46.240 line:0%
She and Grand Commander are a perfect match.

00:31:46.240 --> 00:31:47.720 line:0%
A perfect couple.

00:31:47.880 --> 00:31:49.160 line:0%
A perfect couple?

00:31:49.480 --> 00:31:50.480 line:0%
With all due respect,

00:31:50.480 --> 00:31:51.280 line:0%
the grand commander

00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:52.740 line:0%
is indeed mighty outside,

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:53.640 line:0%
but at home, he's hardly

00:31:53.640 --> 00:31:54.640 line:0%
a good husband.

00:31:54.680 --> 00:31:55.840 line:0%
But Sister

00:31:55.840 --> 00:31:57.520 line:0%
is the top female detective outside

00:31:57.520 --> 00:31:59.550 line:0%
and a model of virtue in the kitchen.

00:31:59.720 --> 00:32:00.480 line:0%
How come he's hardly

00:32:00.480 --> 00:32:01.360 line:0%
a good husband at home?

00:32:01.360 --> 00:32:02.240 line:0%
Shut up.

00:32:02.300 --> 00:32:03.080 line:0%
Do you two have anything important to tell me?

00:32:03.080 --> 00:32:03.760 line:0%
If not, go out.

00:32:03.760 --> 00:32:05.000 line:0%
I want some peace.

00:32:05.280 --> 00:32:06.290 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:32:06.320 --> 00:32:07.760 line:0%
Who said I don't have anything important?

00:32:07.760 --> 00:32:08.830 line:0%
I want to ask

00:32:08.960 --> 00:32:10.640 line:0%
how the medicinal soup is since deer antler

00:32:10.640 --> 00:32:11.760 line:0%
has been replaced with cistanche.

00:32:11.760 --> 00:32:12.690 line:0%
Is it effective?

00:32:12.840 --> 00:32:14.640 line:0%
After all, it's just a cheap substitute.

00:32:14.640 --> 00:32:15.800 line:0%
If it's not effective,

00:32:15.800 --> 00:32:16.520 line:0%
ask Guard Jing to ride a horse

00:32:16.520 --> 00:32:18.200 line:0%
to get some from the neighboring county.

00:32:18.200 --> 00:32:19.360 line:0%
After all, the medicinal soup is for

00:32:19.360 --> 00:32:20.360 line:0%
his grand commander.

00:32:20.360 --> 00:32:21.600 line:0%
Of course he should help.

00:32:21.600 --> 00:32:22.960 line:0%
My grand commander?

00:32:22.960 --> 00:32:23.520 line:0%
Now you're also

00:32:23.520 --> 00:32:24.560 line:0%
being supported by the Imperial Security Bureau, okay?

00:32:24.560 --> 00:32:25.640 line:0%
You also join us in our training every day.

00:32:25.640 --> 00:32:26.240 line:0%
And I was

00:32:26.240 --> 00:32:26.760 line:0%
even forced to accept

00:32:26.760 --> 00:32:27.960 line:0%
an unqualified disciple like you.

00:32:27.960 --> 00:32:28.760 line:0%
Guard Jing,

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:30.240 line:0%
I want to seriously tell you

00:32:30.240 --> 00:32:31.240 line:0%
there is only one master

00:32:31.240 --> 00:32:32.320 line:0%
I truly want.

00:32:32.320 --> 00:32:32.960 line:0%
That's the one right in front of you:

00:32:32.960 --> 00:32:34.200 line:0%
Secretary Yan Xing.

00:32:34.240 --> 00:32:35.560 line:0%
It's just that she won't accept me for now,

00:32:35.560 --> 00:32:36.640 line:0%
so I reluctantly

00:32:36.640 --> 00:32:37.800 line:0%
let you be my master.

00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:38.480 line:0%
Watch your words.

00:32:38.480 --> 00:32:39.680 line:0%
You reluctantly

00:32:39.680 --> 00:32:40.880 line:0%
let me be your master?

00:32:40.920 --> 00:32:41.600 line:0%
You're the one not speaking properly.

00:32:41.600 --> 00:32:42.040 line:0%
You think I want to

00:32:42.040 --> 00:32:43.120 line:0%
take you as my disciple?

00:32:43.120 --> 00:32:44.240 line:0%
Speak to me properly.

00:32:44.240 --> 00:32:46.060 line:0%
Get out, get out!

00:32:46.080 --> 00:32:47.200 line:0%
Get out!

00:32:47.220 --> 00:32:48.950 line:0%
You better explain it clearly.

00:32:51.390 --> 00:32:52.610 line:0%
Substitute.

00:32:53.520 --> 00:32:55.120 line:0%
A stranger in a foreign land,

00:32:55.150 --> 00:32:57.030 line:0%
reunited with an old acquaintance.

00:32:57.030 --> 00:32:58.540 line:0%
A man and a woman, alone together.

00:32:58.540 --> 00:33:00.400 line:0%
A moment of misplaced affection.

00:33:00.700 --> 00:33:02.000 line:0%
Perhaps the warmth and tenderness

00:33:02.000 --> 00:33:03.080 line:0%
I felt

00:33:03.800 --> 00:33:04.920 line:0%
were merely because I was treated as

00:33:04.920 --> 00:33:06.320 line:0%
a substitute for Xiuxiu.

00:33:08.500 --> 00:33:09.520 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:33:09.540 --> 00:33:11.940 line:0%
you still have the mood to think about this?

00:33:12.600 --> 00:33:13.400 line:0%
Xing.

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:17.250 line:0%
Are you saying

00:33:17.280 --> 00:33:18.600 line:0%
Governor Mo has agreed

00:33:18.600 --> 00:33:19.720 line:0%
to merge the bride kidnapping case

00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:21.400 line:0%
with the headless corpse case?

00:33:21.400 --> 00:33:22.600 line:0%
Not entirely,

00:33:22.630 --> 00:33:23.640 line:0%
but he agreed that after

00:33:23.640 --> 00:33:24.960 line:0%
a preliminary examination by the coroner,

00:33:24.960 --> 00:33:26.080 line:0%
I can conduct a comparative investigation

00:33:26.080 --> 00:33:27.200 line:0%
of both corpses.

00:33:27.240 --> 00:33:28.600 line:0%
At least there's a possibility of merging the cases.

00:33:28.600 --> 00:33:30.300 line:0%
Do you want to go examine the bodies together?

00:33:30.300 --> 00:33:31.850 line:0%
Okay, let's go now.

00:33:32.280 --> 00:33:34.410 line:0%
Sister, I'll get your toolkit for you.

00:33:40.490 --> 00:33:41.610 line:0%
Sister, here.

00:33:43.320 --> 00:33:44.120 line:0%
Let's go.

00:33:46.020 --> 00:33:54.060 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:33:46.120 --> 00:33:46.920 line:0%
Be careful.

00:33:54.930 --> 00:33:57.590 line:0%
Sister seems to have a lot to talk about with him.

00:33:58.320 --> 00:33:59.840 line:0%
Madam just finds you noisy.

00:33:59.840 --> 00:34:00.800 line:0%
She finds you noisy.

00:34:00.570 --> 00:34:03.880 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:34:00.840 --> 00:34:02.040 line:0%
You're even noisier.

00:34:02.340 --> 00:34:03.540 line:0%
You're the noisy one.

00:34:05.040 --> 00:34:06.280 line:0%
Kid.

00:34:09.990 --> 00:34:10.800 line:0%
No.

00:34:10.990 --> 00:34:12.640 line:0%
I can't let them have too much to talk about.

00:34:12.640 --> 00:34:20.080 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:34:15.680 --> 00:34:16.810 line:0%
Where are you going?

00:34:18.820 --> 00:34:19.660 line:0%
Kid.

00:34:23.640 --> 00:34:25.280 line:0%
What do you think about

00:34:25.280 --> 00:34:26.479 line:0%
the killer's traits?

00:34:27.800 --> 00:34:28.800 line:0%
Not much.

00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:31.510 line:0%
But Yingzhou City is buzzing.

00:34:31.920 --> 00:34:33.680 line:0%
Everyone swears

00:34:33.680 --> 00:34:34.640 line:0%
the killer

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:35.800 line:0%
is the infamous

00:34:35.840 --> 00:34:37.700 line:0%
Half-faced Ghost in Gannan Area.

00:34:39.600 --> 00:34:40.920 line:0%
They say the Half-faced Ghost

00:34:40.920 --> 00:34:41.600 line:0%
only eats one part

00:34:41.600 --> 00:34:43.320 line:0%
of the victim's body each time.

00:34:43.320 --> 00:34:45.030 line:0%
That does match

00:34:45.080 --> 00:34:46.209 line:0%
the first two cases.

00:34:46.280 --> 00:34:48.360 line:0%
Folktales about ghosts and monsters are common.

00:34:48.360 --> 00:34:50.280 line:0%
It's one thing for ordinary people to believe them.

00:34:50.280 --> 00:34:51.760 line:0%
But you, the greatest detective,

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:52.880 line:0%
believe in ghosts too?

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:54.340 line:0%
I don't believe in ghosts.

00:34:54.680 --> 00:34:56.080 line:0%
I just respect the rumor.

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:58.660 line:0%
No matter where the rumor begins,

00:34:58.920 --> 00:35:00.680 line:0%
since it has spread throughout the city,

00:35:00.680 --> 00:35:01.940 line:0%
there must be a reason.

00:35:02.000 --> 00:35:04.000 line:0%
Either a hidden master is behind it,

00:35:04.160 --> 00:35:06.080 line:0%
or it reflects the local situation.

00:35:06.080 --> 00:35:07.000 line:0%
Do you

00:35:07.320 --> 00:35:09.250 line:0%
still remember how the rumor goes?

00:35:09.320 --> 00:35:10.520 line:0%
The Half-faced Ghost

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:12.720 line:0%
attacks when people are unconscious.

00:35:12.720 --> 00:35:14.250 line:0%
After the victims wake up,

00:35:14.400 --> 00:35:16.480 line:0%
they find themselves losing limbs.

00:35:16.560 --> 00:35:17.360 line:0%
Correct.

00:35:17.360 --> 00:35:18.420 line:0%
That's exactly why

00:35:18.440 --> 00:35:19.640 line:0%
all investigations into the Half-faced Ghost cases

00:35:19.640 --> 00:35:21.200 line:0%
always end up going nowhere.

00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:22.000 line:0%
First,

00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:23.280 line:0%
the killer didn't take lives.

00:35:23.280 --> 00:35:24.080 line:0%
Second,

00:35:24.280 --> 00:35:25.890 line:0%
everyone fears ghosts and spirits.

00:35:25.890 --> 00:35:27.160 line:0%
The victims are terrified

00:35:27.160 --> 00:35:28.480 line:0%
and dare not cooperate,

00:35:28.480 --> 00:35:30.080 line:0%
so in the end, the cases are left unsolved.

00:35:30.080 --> 00:35:30.880 line:0%
Also,

00:35:31.520 --> 00:35:32.720 line:0%
these two corpses...

00:35:33.720 --> 00:35:35.130 line:0%
These two victims

00:35:35.320 --> 00:35:36.580 line:0%
were alive

00:35:36.720 --> 00:35:38.600 line:0%
when they were beheaded or had their eyes gouged out.

00:35:38.600 --> 00:35:40.400 line:0%
And they died in the end.

00:35:43.480 --> 00:35:44.520 line:0%
Either the killer

00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:46.360 line:0%
is not the Half-faced Ghost,

00:35:46.520 --> 00:35:47.560 line:0%
or the killer

00:35:47.720 --> 00:35:50.520 line:0%
failed to imitate the Half-faced Ghost properly.

00:35:55.330 --> 00:35:57.480 line:0%
Secretary Yan, only you don't fear ghosts

00:35:57.480 --> 00:35:58.600 line:0%
and have the courage

00:35:58.600 --> 00:35:59.840 line:0%
to wade into this mess

00:35:59.840 --> 00:36:01.120 line:0%
with me.

00:36:01.200 --> 00:36:02.000 line:0%
What's there

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:03.400 line:0%
to fear about a murderer?

00:36:03.800 --> 00:36:05.430 line:0%
Whether it's a human or a ghost,

00:36:05.430 --> 00:36:07.550 line:0%
a killer must pay the price.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:09.320 line:0%
Even if it's an evil spirit,

00:36:09.320 --> 00:36:10.440 line:0%
we should

00:36:10.440 --> 00:36:12.440 line:0%
judge it in place of the King of Hell.

00:36:17.560 --> 00:36:18.360 line:0%
You...

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:20.120 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:36:25.660 --> 00:36:27.500 line:0%
The body has abrasions.

00:36:27.640 --> 00:36:28.760 line:0%
It should be external trauma

00:36:28.760 --> 00:36:30.040 line:0%
from falling into a cellar.

00:36:30.040 --> 00:36:31.300 line:0%
No internal injuries.

00:36:31.320 --> 00:36:32.000 line:0%
The cause of death

00:36:32.000 --> 00:36:34.040 line:0%
is instantaneous cardiac rupture.

00:36:34.200 --> 00:36:35.280 line:0%
The body is purplish and swollen

00:36:35.280 --> 00:36:36.580 line:0%
and shows signs of decomposition.

00:36:36.580 --> 00:36:37.600 line:0%
The ruptured heart

00:36:37.600 --> 00:36:39.760 line:0%
accelerated the decomposition process.

00:36:39.760 --> 00:36:41.000 line:0%
Inside his abdomen

00:36:41.040 --> 00:36:42.800 line:0%
should now be mush.

00:36:43.040 --> 00:36:44.480 line:0%
The wound marks this time

00:36:44.480 --> 00:36:46.360 line:0%
are completely different from those on the headless corpses.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:47.600 line:0%
They're cleaner.

00:36:47.760 --> 00:36:48.760 line:0%
Any findings?

00:36:50.680 --> 00:36:52.040 line:0%
I can't recall at the moment

00:36:52.040 --> 00:36:53.900 line:0%
what kind of weapon this could be.

00:36:53.930 --> 00:36:55.000 line:0%
But it's definitely not

00:36:55.000 --> 00:36:56.080 line:0%
the Curved Sword from the Western Region

00:36:56.080 --> 00:36:57.280 line:0%
we've seen before.

00:36:58.560 --> 00:37:00.400 line:0%
It seems to be custom-made.

00:37:01.200 --> 00:37:02.260 line:0%
You mean...

00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:05.680 line:0%
a weapon designed specially for gouging out eyes?

00:37:06.400 --> 00:37:08.060 line:0%
Something like this, I guess.

00:37:11.840 --> 00:37:13.320 line:0%
But I'm not sure

00:37:13.340 --> 00:37:15.060 line:0%
if such a thing really exists.

00:37:17.420 --> 00:37:18.480 line:0%
A knuckle-duster?

00:37:19.080 --> 00:37:20.120 line:0%
It does exist?

00:37:20.680 --> 00:37:21.360 line:0%
It's a weapon

00:37:21.360 --> 00:37:22.840 line:0%
worn on fingers.

00:37:23.320 --> 00:37:24.400 line:0%
It's sharp enough

00:37:24.560 --> 00:37:26.090 line:0%
to rival swords and knives.

00:37:26.360 --> 00:37:28.840 line:0%
However, this type of weapon is too vicious.

00:37:28.920 --> 00:37:29.600 line:0%
Usually, only those

00:37:29.600 --> 00:37:31.600 line:0%
who practice dark arts would use it.

00:37:32.080 --> 00:37:33.120 line:0%
The killer used it

00:37:33.440 --> 00:37:35.000 line:0%
on a small-time thug.

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.200 line:0%
That's something

00:37:36.360 --> 00:37:37.620 line:0%
worth thinking about.

00:37:38.400 --> 00:37:39.850 line:0%
So,

00:37:40.320 --> 00:37:41.760 line:0%
this case is not directly linked

00:37:41.760 --> 00:37:43.360 line:0%
to the headless corpse case.

00:37:43.640 --> 00:37:44.840 line:0%
But the killer murdered someone

00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:46.560 line:0%
and took his eyes.

00:37:46.840 --> 00:37:48.200 line:0%
I have no idea

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:50.330 line:0%
why the killer did that.

00:38:10.600 --> 00:38:11.930 line:0%
Come take a look at this.

00:38:25.070 --> 00:38:26.680 line:0%
Something's off.

00:38:27.450 --> 00:38:29.500 line:0%
There are faint

00:38:29.680 --> 00:38:30.880 line:0%
blue traces

00:38:30.880 --> 00:38:32.000 line:0%
on the skin.

00:38:41.400 --> 00:38:42.400 line:0%
If you're feeling tired,

00:38:42.400 --> 00:38:43.400 line:0%
go back and rest.

00:38:43.480 --> 00:38:44.440 line:0%
Leave this to me.

00:38:44.920 --> 00:38:45.760 line:0%
I'm fine.

00:38:46.040 --> 00:38:47.560 line:0%
I just didn't sleep well last night,

00:38:47.560 --> 00:38:49.360 line:0%
so my mind is a little unfocused.

00:38:50.400 --> 00:38:51.200 line:0%
Last night...

00:38:51.660 --> 00:38:52.660 line:0%
you two...

00:38:54.440 --> 00:38:56.040 line:0%
What's wrong with you today?

00:38:56.340 --> 00:38:57.870 line:0%
Did you two get into a fight?

00:39:04.660 --> 00:39:05.920 line:0%
The grand commander

00:39:06.160 --> 00:39:07.560 line:0%
sure keeps a close watch.

00:39:14.160 --> 00:39:16.210 line:0%
At first glance, she's just an ordinary young lady.

00:39:16.210 --> 00:39:17.610 line:0%
Yet, when investigating a case,

00:39:17.610 --> 00:39:19.200 line:0%
she can cast aside

00:39:19.200 --> 00:39:20.200 line:0%
all discomfort

00:39:20.220 --> 00:39:21.450 line:0%
and fear,

00:39:22.040 --> 00:39:23.880 line:0%
and throw herself fully into the task.

00:39:23.880 --> 00:39:24.880 line:0%
Yan Xing

00:39:24.900 --> 00:39:26.760 line:0%
is truly an extraordinary woman.

00:39:27.840 --> 00:39:28.920 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:30.800 line:0%
you're spacing out

00:39:30.800 --> 00:39:32.080 line:0%
in this stinking morgue.

00:39:32.080 --> 00:39:33.880 line:0%
I must say, I'm truly impressed.

00:39:35.280 --> 00:39:36.320 line:0%
Spacing out?

00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:38.060 line:0%
What were you thinking about?

00:39:38.060 --> 00:39:39.000 line:0%
You have a new idea

00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:40.320 line:0%
about the corpse?

00:39:42.280 --> 00:39:43.250 line:0%
Not really.

00:39:43.760 --> 00:39:45.240 line:0%
It's just that I've never seen

00:39:45.240 --> 00:39:47.030 line:0%
a meticulous and fearless woman

00:39:47.030 --> 00:39:48.560 line:0%
like you before.

00:39:48.840 --> 00:39:49.920 line:0%
After seeing you today,

00:39:49.920 --> 00:39:50.940 line:0%
I'm truly impressed.

00:39:50.940 --> 00:39:52.040 line:0%
You don't have to tell me

00:39:52.040 --> 00:39:53.170 line:0%
if you don't want to.

00:39:53.360 --> 00:39:54.160 line:0%
No need to make up

00:39:54.160 --> 00:39:55.690 line:0%
such a far-fetched excuse.

00:39:57.440 --> 00:39:58.400 line:0%
By the way,

00:39:58.920 --> 00:40:00.080 line:0%
before we came,

00:40:00.100 --> 00:40:02.100 line:0%
had the body been handled in any way?

00:40:02.280 --> 00:40:03.240 line:0%
As far as I know,

00:40:03.660 --> 00:40:05.590 line:0%
no other treatments were applied.

00:40:06.040 --> 00:40:08.290 line:0%
Only some preservative solution

00:40:08.400 --> 00:40:09.800 line:0%
was applied on the wound.

00:40:11.560 --> 00:40:12.320 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:40:12.320 --> 00:40:13.240 line:0%
please get me some

00:40:13.240 --> 00:40:14.640 line:0%
preservative solution.

00:40:15.600 --> 00:40:16.400 line:0%
What?

00:40:18.280 --> 00:40:19.080 line:0%
I'll go.

00:40:19.480 --> 00:40:20.280 line:0%
You go.

00:40:49.530 --> 00:40:50.370 line:0%
What's this?

00:40:50.920 --> 00:40:51.960 line:0%
Everyone laughs

00:40:52.080 --> 00:40:53.450 line:0%
at the moths flying into the flame,

00:40:53.450 --> 00:40:55.510 line:0%
unaware they are mayflies.

00:40:55.540 --> 00:40:58.310 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk. Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:40:58.310 --> 00:40:59.880 line:0%
The moths endure the fire and do not die,

00:40:59.880 --> 00:41:01.740 line:0%
being reincarnated in the cycle.

00:41:03.270 --> 00:41:04.780 line:0%
It's Fire Moth Sect again.

00:41:07.290 --> 00:41:08.840 line:0%
Brother, yet not a brother.

00:41:09.030 --> 00:41:10.390 line:0%
Man, yet not a man.

00:41:10.560 --> 00:41:11.960 line:0%
Disrespect the fire moth,

00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:13.220 line:0%
and calamity shall descend from the heavens.

00:41:13.220 --> 00:41:14.870 line:0%
Is... Is it a ghost?

00:41:17.160 --> 00:41:18.480 line:0%
It's not a ghost.

00:41:18.530 --> 00:41:20.060 line:0%
Someone is playing tricks.

00:41:20.330 --> 00:41:21.360 line:0%
How did you know

00:41:21.420 --> 00:41:23.370 line:0%
we should use preservative solution?

00:41:23.370 --> 00:41:26.090 line:0%
My master told me that in the Western Region,

00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:27.730 line:0%
when sending secret messages,

00:41:27.730 --> 00:41:29.240 line:0%
the sender would use rice soup

00:41:29.240 --> 00:41:31.080 line:0%
to write on parchment.

00:41:31.330 --> 00:41:32.490 line:0%
And once dried,

00:41:32.520 --> 00:41:34.720 line:0%
the words would disappear completely.

00:41:34.890 --> 00:41:36.280 line:0%
When receiving it, the recipient

00:41:36.280 --> 00:41:37.460 line:0%
would apply preservative solution

00:41:37.460 --> 00:41:38.850 line:0%
on the parchment.

00:41:39.030 --> 00:41:40.270 line:0%
Then the words would turn blue

00:41:40.270 --> 00:41:42.220 line:0%
and reappear on the parchment.

00:41:42.250 --> 00:41:43.290 line:0%
I just checked.

00:41:43.310 --> 00:41:44.660 line:0%
The severed skin at the neck

00:41:44.660 --> 00:41:45.900 line:0%
also has blue traces.

00:41:45.920 --> 00:41:47.200 line:0%
So I decided to try it.

00:42:06.160 --> 00:42:07.810 line:0%
Rapists and robbers

00:42:07.830 --> 00:42:09.210 line:0%
deserve to die.

00:42:09.450 --> 00:42:10.870 line:0%
Disrespect the fire moth,

00:42:10.870 --> 00:42:12.540 line:0%
and calamity shall descend from the heavens.

00:42:12.540 --> 00:42:14.570 line:0%
To preserve bodies,

00:42:15.000 --> 00:42:16.320 line:0%
coroners always apply

00:42:16.320 --> 00:42:18.250 line:0%
preservative solution to wounds.

00:42:18.350 --> 00:42:20.040 line:0%
But someone deliberately used rice soup,

00:42:20.040 --> 00:42:22.260 line:0%
which would react with preservative solution to reveal words.

00:42:22.260 --> 00:42:23.560 line:0%
That means

00:42:24.180 --> 00:42:25.370 line:0%
from the beginning,

00:42:25.440 --> 00:42:26.520 line:0%
they never intended

00:42:26.520 --> 00:42:27.980 line:0%
to keep the words a secret.

00:42:28.140 --> 00:42:29.650 line:0%
In fact,

00:42:30.360 --> 00:42:31.560 line:0%
they wanted us

00:42:31.580 --> 00:42:33.010 line:0%
to see them with our own eyes.

00:42:33.010 --> 00:42:34.200 line:0%
These people

00:42:35.200 --> 00:42:36.780 line:0%
don't fear us linking

00:42:37.030 --> 00:42:38.280 line:0%
Fire Moth Sect

00:42:38.360 --> 00:42:40.240 line:0%
to the Half-faced Ghost at all.

00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:42.020 line:0%
The accusation

00:42:42.320 --> 00:42:44.200 line:0%
is like an arrogant display.

00:42:44.220 --> 00:42:45.550 line:0%
As if they're telling us

00:42:45.730 --> 00:42:47.500 line:0%
Fire Moth Sect's reach in Gannan Area

00:42:47.500 --> 00:42:48.500 line:0%
runs deeper

00:42:48.520 --> 00:42:50.060 line:0%
than we imagined.

00:42:50.290 --> 00:42:51.710 line:0%
As we investigate the case,

00:42:51.710 --> 00:42:52.910 line:0%
our every move

00:42:52.930 --> 00:42:54.730 line:0%
is under their surveillance.

00:42:55.310 --> 00:42:56.910 line:0%
Disrespect the fire moth,

00:42:57.690 --> 00:42:59.100 line:0%
and calamity shall descend from the heavens.